{
"#name"
:
{
"claude"
:
null
,
"zh"
:
"为 Claude Code 打造的命令行增强模块"
,
"en"
:
"Enhanced command-line module for Claude Code"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"claude-code 是由 Anthropic 团队开发的终端 AI 编程代理，集成 Claude Opus 或 Sonnet 模型，可读取本地代码库、生成补丁、执行命令、运行测试，并自动创建 Git 提交与 PR。\n它具备对大型代码库的语义搜索能力，支持子代理任务拆分，并通过自然语言指令协助完成日常开发工作，提升效率。\n项目地址：https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code\n"
,
"en"
:
"claude-code is a terminal-based AI programming agent developed by Anthropic.\nPowered by Claude Opus or Sonnet models, it enables semantic codebase search, patch generation, command execution, and Git operations through natural language.\nIt supports sub-agent workflows for parallelized tasks and enhances developer productivity directly from the command line.\nProject: https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"x-cmd 提供了多种方式来使用第三方模型运行 claude-code：\n- 即调即用：使用 `x claude mm`（MiniMax）、`x claude glm`（智谱）、`x claude or`（OpenRouter）等命令，从对应模块获取 API Key 直接运行 claude-code\n- 全局配置：使用 `x claude use glm` 将配置写入 ~/.claude/settings.json，之后直接运行 `claude` 命令就会使用该模型\n- 项目配置：使用 `x claude use --project glm` 将配置写入当前项目的 .claude/settings.local.json，仅影响当前项目\n"
,
"en"
:
"x-cmd provides multiple ways to run claude-code with third-party models:\n- On-demand: Use commands like `x claude mm` (MiniMax), `x claude glm` (Zhipu), `x claude or` (OpenRouter) to fetch the API key from the corresponding module and run claude-code directly\n- Global config: Use `x claude use glm` to write configuration to ~/.claude/settings.json, then running `claude` directly will use that model\n- Project config: Use `x claude use --project glm` to write configuration to .claude/settings.local.json in the current project, affecting only that project\n"
}
]
,
"--yolo"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"自动批准所有操作（--dangerously-skip-permissions 的别名）"
,
"en"
:
"Automatically approve all operations (alias for --dangerously-skip-permissions)"
}
}
,
"use"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"配置 claude-code 使用指定的第三方模型提供商"
,
"en"
:
"Configure claude-code to use a specified third-party model provider"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"使用 `use` 命令可以将 claude-code 切换到第三方模型提供商（如 DeepSeek、Kimi 等）。\n该命令会修改 ~/.claude/settings.json 文件，设置相应的环境变量。\n支持的提供商：ds/deepseek、kimi、mm/minimax、mt/mthreads、glm/zhipu、sili、openrouter、doubao、ali、baidu、tencent、custom/other\n\n场景选择：\n- 如果你需要即调即用不同模型，可以使用 `x claude mm`（MiniMax）、`x claude glm`（智谱）、`x claude or`（OpenRouter）等命令，这些命令会从对应模块获取 API Key 直接运行 claude-code\n- 如果你希望 claude 命令永久使用特定厂商模型（例如希望每次运行 `claude` 直接使用智谱 glm），则使用 `x claude use glm`，这会将配置写入 ~/.claude/settings.json\n- 如果你只想在当前项目使用特定厂商，可使用 `x claude use --project glm`，这会将配置写入当前项目的 .claude/settings.local.json\n"
,
"en"
:
"Use the `use` command to switch claude-code to a third-party model provider (e.g., DeepSeek, Kimi, etc.).\nThis command modifies ~/.claude/settings.json to set the appropriate environment variables.\nSupported providers: ds/deepseek, kimi, mm/minimax, mt/mthreads, glm/zhipu, sili, openrouter, doubao, ali, baidu, tencent, custom/other\n\nChoosing the right approach:\n- For on-demand use with different models, use commands like `x claude mm` (MiniMax), `x claude glm` (Zhipu), `x claude or` (OpenRouter), etc. These commands fetch the API key from the corresponding module and run claude-code directly\n- If you want the `claude` command to permanently use a specific provider (e.g., always use Zhipu glm when running `claude`), use `x claude use glm`, which writes the configuration to ~/.claude/settings.json\n- If you only want to use a specific provider for the current project, use `x claude use --project glm`, which writes the configuration to .claude/settings.local.json in the current project\n"
}
]
,
