"--project|-p"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"将配置写入项目级 settings.local.json（.claude/settings.local.json）而非全局配置"
,
"en"
:
"Write configuration to project-level settings.local.json (.claude/settings.local.json) instead of global"
}
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude use ds"
,
"zh"
:
"配置 claude-code 使用 DeepSeek V4 模型（全局）"
,
"en"
:
"Configure claude-code to use the DeepSeek V4 model (global)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude use --project glm"
,
"zh"
:
"在当前项目使用智谱 glm 模型（仅影响当前项目）"
,
"en"
:
"Use Zhipu glm model for the current project (project-level only)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude use --project mm"
,
"zh"
:
"在当前项目使用 MiniMax 模型（仅影响当前项目）"
,
"en"
:
"Use MiniMax model for the current project (project-level only)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude use other \"https://token-plan-cn.xiaomimimo.com/anthropic\" MIMO_API_KEY mimo-v2.5-pro"
,
"zh"
:
"配置 claude-code 使用 Xiaomi Token Plan 套餐"
,
"en"
:
"Configure claude-code to use Xiaomi Token Plan"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude use other \"http://localhost:11434\" \"ollama\" \"gpt-oss:20b\""
,
"zh"
:
"配置 claude-code 使用本地 ollama 服务的 gpt-oss:20b 模型"
,
"en"
:
"Configure claude-code to use the local ollama service with the gpt-oss:20b model"
}
]
}
,
"unuse"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"移除 claude-code 的第三方模型提供商配置，恢复使用默认 Anthropic API"
,
"en"
:
"Remove third-party model provider configuration from claude-code and revert to default Anthropic API"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"使用 `unuse` 命令可以移除 ~/.claude/settings.json 中的自定义提供商配置，\n使 claude-code 恢复使用默认的 Anthropic API 和模型。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Use the `unuse` command to remove custom provider configuration from ~/.claude/settings.json,\nreverting claude-code to use the default Anthropic API and models.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude unuse"
,
"zh"
:
"移除第三方模型配置，恢复使用 Anthropic 官方 API"
,
"en"
:
"Remove third-party model configuration and revert to Anthropic official API"
}
]
}
,
"openrouter|or"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"启动 claude-code 并通过 OpenRouter 接入 AI 模型"
,
"en"
:
"Launch claude-code and access AI models via OpenRouter"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"使用 `x openrouter --cfg apikey=\"<your api key>\"` 来配置 API key，以便 claude-code 能通过 OpenRouter 正常访问 AI 模型"
,
"en"
:
"Use `x openrouter --cfg apikey=\"<your api key>\"` to configure the API key, allowing claude-code to access AI models through OpenRouter properly"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x openrouter init"
,
"zh"
:
"交互配置 openrouter 的 API key，该配置会被用于 claude 模块，同时也会被应用于 openrouter、codex 等 LLM 应用模块"
,
"en"
:
"Interactively configure the OpenRouter API key. This configuration will be used by the claude module and shared with other LLM-related modules such as openrouter and codex"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x openrouter --cfg apikey=\"<your api key>\""
,
"zh"
:
"一句命令直接配置 openrouter 的 API key，该配置会被用于 claude 模块，同时也会被应用于 openrouter、codex 等 LLM 应用模块"
,
"en"
:
"Configure the OpenRouter API key in a single command. This configuration will be used by the claude module and shared with other LLM-related modules such as openrouter and codex"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude or"
,
"zh"
:
"启动 claude-code 并通过 OpenRouter 接入 AI 模型"
,
"en"
:
"Launch claude-code with AI models accessed through OpenRouter"
}
]
}
,
