"team|teams"
:
{
"#tag"
:
[
"inner"
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"管理 Claude Code 的 Agent Teams 功能"
,
"en"
:
"Manage Agent Teams feature for Claude Code"
}
,
"enable|on"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"启用 Agent Teams 功能"
,
"en"
:
"Enable Agent Teams feature"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"启用 Agent Teams 后，Claude Code 支持多个子代理并行工作，提升复杂任务的处理效率。\n另外，该功能可通过设置环境变量 CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS=1 来开启。\n"
,
"en"
:
"After enabling Agent Teams, Claude Code supports multiple sub-agents working in parallel to improve handling of complex tasks.\nAlternatively, this feature can be enabled by setting the environment variable CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS=1.\n"
}
]
}
,
"disable|off"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"禁用 Agent Teams 功能"
,
"en"
:
"Disable Agent Teams feature"
}
}
,
"mode"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"设置 teammate 的运行模式"
,
"en"
:
"Set the teammate running mode"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"模式类型 (auto/in-process/tmux)"
,
"en"
:
"Mode type (auto/in-process/tmux)"
}
,
"#cand"
:
[
"tmux"
,
"auto"
,
"in-process"
]
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"zh"
:
"- in-process：队友在主终端内运行，按 Shift+Down 切换队友并发送消息，无需额外设置\n- tmux：启用 split panes 模式（需 tmux 或 iTerm2），每个队友有独立窗格，可同时查看所有人输出\n- auto：默认值，已在 tmux 中则用 split panes，否则用 in-process\n"
,
"en"
:
"- in-process: Teammates run in main terminal. Press Shift+Down to switch and message. No setup needed.\n- tmux: Enable split panes mode (requires tmux or iTerm2). Each teammate gets own pane, see all output at once.\n- auto: Default. Uses split panes if already in tmux, otherwise in-process.\n"
}
]
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude team on"
,
"zh"
:
"启用 Agent Teams 功能"
,
"en"
:
"Enable Agent Teams feature"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude team off"
,
"zh"
:
"禁用 Agent Teams 功能"
,
"en"
:
"Disable Agent Teams feature"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claude team mode tmux"
,
"zh"
:
"设置 teammate 模式为 tmux（split panes 模式）"
,
"en"
:
"Set teammate mode to tmux（split panes mode）"
}
]
}
,
"skill"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"管理 Claude Skills"
,
"en"
:
"Manage Claude skills"
}
,
